            "opened": true,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p><strong>Breescape. Built to sleep through.</strong></p><p>Powered by <strong>patented BlendTek™ technology</strong>, our bedding is made from a carefully balanced mix of fibers—each chosen for its breathability, moisture-wicking properties, delivering <strong>temp-regulating comfort</strong> that keeps you <strong>fresh, dry, and comfortable all night</strong>.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dual-Sided Comfort:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Breathable Side:</strong> 58% Eco-Cosy® Viscose, 42% Nylon</li><li><strong>Fill: </strong>30% Naia™ Acetate, 70% Polyester</li><li><strong>Cool Side:</strong> 69% Nylon, 20% Polyester, 11% Spandex</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>More Comfort:</strong></p><p>Every size—from Twin to King—is <strong>up to 13.8% larger than standard</strong>, providing full coverage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gentle on Skin</strong></p><p>OEKO-TEX® certified (Certificate No. SH025 256533) for safe, skin-friendly comfort — ideal even for the most sensitive skin.</p>",
            "page": "",
